<title>ESTONIA: ESTONIA-EESTI GAAS IN 2.1 MLN LOSS IN H1.</title>
<headline>ESTONIA-EESTI GAAS IN 2.1 MLN LOSS IN H1.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eesti Gaas (Estonian Gas) said on Tuesday it had a net loss of 2.1 million kroons in the first six months of 1997.</p>
<p>Its net turnover was 346 million kroons, down from 374 million kroons in the same period last year, the company's managing director Aarne Saar told Reuters.</p>
<p>&quot;The decrease in turnover stems from the fall in sales during the first quarter...when it was (unseasonably) warm,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Eesti Gaas said earlier that it planned to break even this year.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
